IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MP4-RENDER.

DATA DIVISION.
01 VIDEO-FRAMES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ASPECT-WIDTH        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SCENE-COUNT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 RENDER-SCORE        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MP4-RENDER.
    IF VIDEO-FRAMES < 5400
        GO TO RENDER-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF ASPECT-WIDTH < 1920
        GO TO RENDER-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF SCENE-COUNT < 7
        GO TO RENDER-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9999 TO RENDER-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 VIDEO-FRAMES.
    WEIGHT 30 SCENE-COUNT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

RENDER-ERROR.
    MOVE 0 TO RENDER-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
